Attribution: "King Tat Wong, Machine-checked certificate that Haugland's
2131-vertex Moser-spindle-free unit-distance graph is 5-chromatic (2026)".

Data statement
--------------
* The graphs G1 (740 vertices) and G3 (2131 vertices) are the constructions of
  Jan Kristian Haugland, arXiv:2608.04542 v4, reconstructed here from the
  paper's definitions in exact cyclotomic arithmetic. The mathematical content
  of the construction is his; please cite the paper.
* Every DRAT/LRAT proof, CNF file, cube file and colouring in this release was
  generated on the author's machine by the tools listed in README.md §3 and can
  be regenerated with the commands in README.md §4.3. The solvers are
  deterministic; re-running the same binaries reproduces the proofs.
* No third-party data other than the paper's published definitions (including
  the Appendix A path list, transcribed in scripts/refs/appendixA_paths.json) is
  included.
* The certificates are provided as is; their validity is exactly what the
  checkers (drat-trim, cake_lpr, exactfield.py) report on the files listed in
  SHA256SUMS and SHA256SUMS.bundle, nothing more.
